Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nplans, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon.\NOut on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI want to take you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.76,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.48,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that I wanna take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head forth and.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.96,0:02:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Vito, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so good. Get this,\Nthe president of the W.E.J.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and Jeremy's boss are\Ntalking right now Why
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,should I be surprised\Nthat two guys are talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They got ears in their mouth, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just saying, it's\Na real VIP show, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.66,0:03:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The eldest son and the\Nminister of candy, Perospero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The eldest daughter and the\Nminister of fruit, Capote.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The second son, Sweet General Katakuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.78,0:03:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The 14th daughter, Sweet General Smoothie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The third son, Daifugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fourth son, Oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a whole den of beasts in\Nthere, I'm telling you, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, when all of them were on\Nour side, that was swell, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that they're gonna be our\Nenemies, it does make me worry a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you got time to think stupid\Ncrap, go check downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move, Gabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I hear, the wedding\Ncake will be quite a sight to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, it's Mother Carmel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we're graced by our dear mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's smiling brightly\Nas always, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.56,0:04:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a shining sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,shedding its rays on your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.54,0:04:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,daughter's wedding that's correct why
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,mother carmel is the light of the\Nworld i have no idea who this lady is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you must excuse me this is the first\Ntea party i've been to i see that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,you are very fond of this woman\Nhere but how are you related exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,These are my memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So keep your nose out of my business!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How's everything going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The cooks finished prepping,\Nso they're off work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're celebrating with a banquet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.64,0:05:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We blocked all the passages\Nwhile they were distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.26,0:05:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That should keep reinforcements from\Ncoming up to the roof for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, we'll set the horn transponder\Nsnails to jam any signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Once this goes down, the\Nwhole venue will be isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to set up for you-know-what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlotte, we brought a little\Ngift to you and your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing special, but I have a\Nfeeling it might be right up your alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I do love a good treasure chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know me well, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet it's got something\Nlovely hidden inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you a treasure\Nchest as well, Lin-Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please accept this one for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And I got you a rare treasure from\Nthe south to give you a little hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My treasure comes from the farthest\Nreaches of the northern sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's so generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole mountain of treasure,\Nand it's all for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This really is the perfect day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of treasure chests, Mami-ga,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you've landed a priceless\Nheirloom from deep undersea. Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.24,0:06:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You have ears everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I'd expect nothing less, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A treasure passed down for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A cherished symbol of undersea royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea why Neptune let it go after\Nall these years, but it's mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A legendary treasure here just for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the tomate box i admit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it's rather steeply
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,never mind the box what's inside so have\Nyou opened it yet i must know actually i've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,been saving it for the big feast after\Npudding's wedding i'll open it along with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:07:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,all my other treasure\Nchests it's even more
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fun if we can enjoy it\Ntogether, right? Ha,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Vito, all wrapped up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready to go, little old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and get changed, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar, bring out the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name isn't Caesar, it's Gastino!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the entrance\Nto the tea party, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh it up while you can, scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.86,0:07:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get what's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Caesar Clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you ain't scum, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.32,0:07:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, go hide that mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need it in a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When big mom starts\Nscreaming, that's your cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly into the hall and\Nbring that mirror with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy Pass, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our only escape route,\Nso everyone's counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, don't\Nget any funny ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I'd wait till\Nnow to betray you? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Veggie and his crew are up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If we suffer an information leak, this\Nwhole thing goes down to drink, capisce?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We got 30 minutes to the big event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Straw Hat and his little\Ncrew ready to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We better not be running\Naround like some kind of moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.64,0:08:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are you asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The brat is inside your body, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you buffoons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them rest for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They've had quite a journey\Nsince they've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.86,0:08:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wake them up ten\Nminutes before we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:09:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You do what you want, but I'll ditch\Nthem the second they get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.26,0:09:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm watching the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure everything is in order
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe him No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're done, you\Nbetter get back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to walk into the venue myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need everyone to be on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we go through that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready to make this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot's riding on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thin smoke, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I wasn't planning on\Ngetting married when I came out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.60,0:09:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it's kind of strange sitting\Nside by side with you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm living in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay cool, stay cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for her charms!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A good dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a bad dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, is she cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a good dream, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness. I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it together, you jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.06,0:10:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's planning to shoot you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What if this is the real her and\Nwhat I saw before was a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You had it right before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.80,0:10:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just ah
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Was thinking about our kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might be shy doing\Nit in front of all the people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,could just kiss you on\Nthe forehead if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the group falling from\Nthe ceiling in a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did all this blood come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.02,0:11:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong\Nwith this little freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything going well, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't noticed anything.\NThat's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's wedding has to go off without a\Nlickety hitch—in other words, stay vigilant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,vigilant
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,12 o 'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 12 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, may\NI have your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our main event's here at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The 35th daughter of Big Mom's\Nfamily, Charlotte Pudding,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And the third prince of the\NGerman kingdom, Vince Smoke Sanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,will join their hands in marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit! Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.78,0:13:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit! Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha! Awesomeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Without further ado, I now\Npresent the Bride and Groove!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate crew led by\Nthe Emperor Big Mom and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the notorious evil army\NChairman Double Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This young couple will\Nbring the two notorious
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,families together in a deadly alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the strength of their bond give\Nrise to a brand new flower of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Blooming madly in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a dove?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Their future's so bright\Nit'll scorch your eyeballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's hear it for the happy couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That nitwit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really selling this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The wedding begins, but\Nwhose blood will be shed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.58,0:15:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The wedding is starting right now. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So much meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji is counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is there a secret to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He was running around a\Nbunch and fell asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and now he's having food\Ndreams, so he must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have any meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That should wake him up. Meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for\Nbreakfast right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Little do you know, this is your Requiem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:17:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Just sit there like human\Ngarbage with that stupid look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji, I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think, maybe, this was meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your wits about you, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lose focus now,\Nshe's gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Merit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Merit! Merit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Merit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:18:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a taste of love and sorrow too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I found love and I was\Nhurt, but I never lost hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll leave the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Count the iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.46,0:18:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain pours down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Danger comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay close, never let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.40,0:18:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And let your passion grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.42,0:18:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A symbol of your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good for a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, a kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This cake is worthy of\Na double-pate strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work, Struzan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, I simply can't praise you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just doing my duty, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:19:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, this lovely cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be our altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lovely, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you are so silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And so did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pudding, so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks just like me\Nwhen I was that age.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And how long ago was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, someone has a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, my, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy it while it lasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.70,0:20:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,my hapless little friends, because\Nsoon it will all come crashing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're nearly at the climax.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, please enjoy the\Nwedding from these VIP seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.22,0:21:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you'll want a\Nfront row view for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your own execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.26,0:21:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the moon and the bride and groom kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bloody banquet will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Vince, folks, but you gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Old Sanji really lucked out, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd have known pudding was that\Nhot, I would have married her myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Marry Big Mom's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.84,0:21:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's nothing but a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.74,0:21:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he's married, he'll be under Big\NMom's thumb for the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.30,0:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last thing I'd want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded by the\Nstrongest Charlotte siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather easy targets, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:22:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And sitting ducks since we're unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.58,0:22:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is better off without Germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, most of us at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to escape Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.64,0:22:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.38,0:22:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But can I trust Captain Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.88,0:22:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do you, Sanji—take pudding\Nto be your lawfully wedded wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to have and to hold in\Nsickness and in health,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.24,0:22:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,for richer or for poorer,\Ntill death do you part!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,part
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.60,0:22:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.68,0:22:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't complain to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.78,0:22:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you plan to remain loyal and\Nto love and cherish each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.20,0:22:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe\Nit's all coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.70,0:23:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.44,0:23:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you collapsing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.96,0:23:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you may lift the\Nveil and kiss the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.26,0:23:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw the future, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.00,0:23:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.54,0:23:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.52,0:24:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you feel\Nwhen you see my hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.10,0:24:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,third eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.32,0:24:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.22,0:24:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.66,0:24:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that you were\Nhiding such a beautiful eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.64,0:25:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I... uh... no, I shouldn't stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.04,0:25:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.02,0:25:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.76,0:25:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him, Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.14,0:25:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.98,0:25:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.64,0:25:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.08,0:25:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, when the happy couple appears,\Nwe'll see Sanji, the man of the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.82,0:25:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, much to his shock and horror, he\Nwill discover that you have a third eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.02,0:25:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He expected a beautiful face,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.32,0:25:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but now he sees his bride for\Nthe monster that she truly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.88,0:25:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be paralyzed with shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.40,0:26:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.20,0:26:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.96,0:26:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard those\Nwords once in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.14,0:26:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just lying to me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.54,0:26:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No one would ever think\Nthis eye is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.78,0:26:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.00,0:26:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on, Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.88,0:26:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him already.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.82,0:26:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.08,0:26:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my daughter, but that\Neye still creeps me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.94,0:26:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cover it with your bangs, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.66,0:26:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.02,0:26:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.42,0:26:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really creeping\Nme out, little monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.64,0:26:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Rose, you're a weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.92,0:26:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.72,0:27:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.78,0:27:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There, that's much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.92,0:27:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Little freak, little freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.34,0:27:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.60,0:27:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.38,0:27:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards, bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.72,0:27:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll murder all of you. Get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.74,0:27:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.36,0:27:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.72,0:27:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this pity? Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.12,0:27:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pastor, it's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.54,0:27:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you tell me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna do this or not, Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.50,0:27:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.04,0:28:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Priest, he'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.36,0:28:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no use. He'll miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.84,0:28:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He dodged.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.26,0:28:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.66,0:28:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, that's your cue. Go! Right! Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.32,0:28:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a gunshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.82,0:28:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest did it—no, he got shot. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.34,0:28:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be why
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.18,0:28:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the hell didn't pudding shoot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.22,0:28:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri, tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.52,0:28:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a bigger problem,\Nmama—something completely unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.64,0:28:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I can't stop this. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.82,0:29:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We fight or are we waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.08,0:29:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we waiting So is this something new?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.58,0:29:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.72,0:29:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.20,0:29:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to do what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.10,0:29:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to take Sanji back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.00,0:29:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.62,0:29:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.38,0:29:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to pop out of the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.14,0:29:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.54,0:29:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.74,0:30:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.16,0:30:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.74,0:30:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.65,0:30:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God!
